(19093,'My fur, doesn\'t it look good today?','',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Agara makes me look good, just like I make her look good.','',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve been told that I\'m the best-looking rider in the skies. I wouldn\'t believe that if I were you. I\'m also the best-looking rider on land, under the sea...well, just about anywhere!','',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you\'re here to admire my serpent. Oh, and Agara is quite impressive too.','',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey, how youuu doing?','',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'After this, me and some of the boys are going to visit The Dancing Serpent Inn for some brew.','',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey rookie, when you\'re at Windward Isle, keep your eyes open for onyx eggs. The Serpent Masters\'ll go nuts if you bring one to them.','',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, are you here from my fan club? I\'m sorry, I\'m not giving autographs right now.','',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(19096,'A studious rider is a successful rider.','',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shouldn\'t you be practicing?','',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The best experience is one\'s own.','',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can tell you my tricks for riding, but they are nothing compared to your own practice and experience.','',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Why am I so fast? If I tell you, I would only be disadvantaging myself.','',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Learn from the masters. I have nothing to teach you, for I am but a student.','',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The other trainees have their skills and talents. I am honored to ride with them.','',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is an honor to ride with you.','',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(19097,'','Hi! How are you?',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','If you need any help, just ask me!',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','Try to remember where the checkpoints are located. Once you know where to pick up the flags, you can chart the shortest course.',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','Flying through cloud rings is the best way to pick up speed. Sometimes it\'s worth going out of the way for that boost of speed!',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','Look around for new paths. Sometimes the fastest way is not the most obvious!',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','I\'ve heard from the other trainees that you can find rare onyx eggs at Windward Isle. I\'ve looked and looked, but I haven\'t found any yet!',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','Skill is important, but sometimes it comes down to luck.',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','Don\'t worry, I\'ll be rooting for you even if you come in last!',0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0),
