(21027,'Where did all of these mogu come from?','Where did all of these mogu come from?',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for rescuing us, $c. Hopefully now our mission will not be lost.','Thank you for rescuing us, $c. Hopefully now our mission will not be lost.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These "elf" creatures. Can they be trusted?','These "elf" creatures. Can they be trusted?',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'First mantid, then mogu. These are dark days indeed.','First mantid, then mogu. These are dark days indeed.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t know what brought you into the Forbidden Jungle, but I am glad it did. You saved us from slavery... or worse.','I don\'t know what brought you into the Forbidden Jungle, but I am glad it did. You saved us from slavery... or worse.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'When did the mogu learn to wield magic portals?','When did the mogu learn to wield magic portals?',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The mogu chose the worst time to attack. The mantid are on the move, and not even the great wall will hold them back.','The mogu chose the worst time to attack. The mantid are on the move, and not even the great wall will hold them back.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our dreams have been haunted by mantid. We hoped the Crane Temple would give us some insight to these visions.','Our dreams have been haunted by mantid. We hoped the Crane Temple would give us some insight to these visions.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),
