(22634,'Wise hozen say: All that glitters is not gold. Unless it is gold. Then it glitters.','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wise hozen say: To seek riches, look within yourself. Or in one of these chests.','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wise hozen say: Appearances can be deceiving, especially if you have bad eyesight.','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wise hozen say: Don\'t bite off more than you can chew, unless there are other hungry hozen nearby.','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wise hozen say: Actions speak louder than words, unless the person is yelling.','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wise hozen say: If at first you don\'t succeed, get someone else to do it for you.','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wise hozen say: Don\'t put off until tomorrow what you can do... oh nevermind, I\'ll tell you the rest later.','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, traveler! I have treasure from all across the world.$B$BYou want to test your luck? Only a few timeless coins for a key.','',0,10,0,0,0,0,0,0),
